<Base title="About Dongming Zhao, LCSW | California Therapist" description="Meet Dongming Zhao, LCSW, a California therapist offering warm, collaborative individual and couples therapy in English and Mandarin." path="/about/">
<section class="section"><div class="shell grid-2"><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">About me</p><h1>Hi, I’m Dongming.</h1><p class="lede">I’m a Licensed Clinical Social Worker in California, providing therapy in English and Mandarin to adults and couples.</p><p>I work with people navigating anxiety, depression, burnout, self-criticism, relationship difficulties, family-of-origin wounds, and the complexities of culture and identity.</p><p>My approach is warm, collaborative, and depth-oriented. I draw from Internal Family Systems (IFS), Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT), Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT), and Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT).</p></div><figure class="portrait reveal"><img src="images/about-dongming.jpg" alt="Portrait of Dongming Zhao, LCSW" width="1200" height="1200"/></figure></div></section>
<section class="section band"><div class="shell grid-2"><figure class="portrait reveal"><img src="images/about-lanterns.jpg" alt="Dongming Zhao outdoors beneath lanterns" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy"/></figure><div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Beyond the therapy room</p><h2>A little more about me</h2><p class="lede">I’m a curious person by nature. I read a lot, especially about psychology, relationships, and culture.</p><p>Outside of work, I enjoy walking, writing, and paying attention to things I find beautiful—art, clothes, interiors, or small details in everyday life.</p><p>I value growth, but I don’t think life needs to become a constant self-improvement project. There should be room to notice and enjoy ordinary life too.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Credentials & approach</p><h2>Care shaped around the person in front of me.</h2><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3>Clinical approaches</h3><p>IFS · EFT · ACT · CBT</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Practice details</h3><p>California Licensed Clinical Social Worker<br/>English & Mandarin<br/>Online throughout California</p></article></div></div></section>
</Base>
